        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong></i> is your interactive desktop toybox, packed <strong>with over 20 quirky fidgets</strong> to click, drag, and toss around. It’s made to sit right next to your everyday work or gaming, turning your desktop into a cozy space where stress melts away and creativity gets a little boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These fidgets aren't just for show, they <strong>react to you</strong>. <strong>Blow into your mic</strong> to inflate a virtual bag, or <strong>connect your camera</strong> to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=800 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resize, move, and arrange</strong> your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It’s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG REPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/27fc3adde8d085eeb70b7923556ea845.avif?t=1758187988\" width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or bugs while playing the game, reporting them through 'Discord' allows for faster resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join 'Discord' via the link on the Steam store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Desktop Fidget</strong></i> is your interactive desktop toybox, packed <strong>with over 20 quirky fidgets</strong> to click, drag, and toss around. It’s made to sit right next to your everyday work or gaming, turning your desktop into a cozy space where stress melts away and creativity gets a little boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense? Just <strong>click, drag, spin, or mash</strong> your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help <strong>keep your hands active</strong> and <strong>your mind calm</strong> during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s