lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1758187988\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1758187988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUG REPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759380/extras/27fc3adde8d085eeb70b7923556ea845.avif?t=1758187988\" width=1560 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or bugs while playing the game, reporting them through 'Discord' allows for faster resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join 'Discord' via the link on the Steam store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
